## Corpus (5 + 10 + 3 = 18 cells, all at distance=1.0, effort=8)

### Synthetic power-line ridges (5 cells)

Built in-process by `make_realistic_power_line_image(w, h, n_wires)`,
mirroring `tests/auto_splines.rs::make_power_line_image` so the chunk-5
screenshot discriminator does NOT fire (stripes + diagonal ramp give
median(mask1x1) ≈ 55, below `SCREENSHOT_MEDIAN_MASK_THRESHOLD = 95`).
All candidates therefore reach the chunk-6 bbox-span gate + chunk-4
trial-encode cost gate.

  realistic_1wire_1024x256   — 1 wire,  long_dim 1024, polylines=2
  realistic_2wires_1024x256  — 2 wires, long_dim 1024, polylines=4
  realistic_4wires_1024x512  — 4 wires, long_dim 1024, polylines=8
  realistic_4wires_2048x512  — 4 wires, long_dim 2048, polylines=16
  realistic_8wires_2048x1024 — 8 wires, long_dim 2048, polylines=32

